  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Global Gateway EU-India Investment Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this action is to strengthen EU&#xbf;India economic cooperation in line with Global Gateway priorities. The Specific Objective of this action is: European private investment fostered in high-potential sectors supporting connectivity, green growth, innovation as well as sustainable, climate-resilient and low-carbon value chains in India. The Outputs to be delivered by this action contributing to the corresponding Specific Objective are:1.1 Preparation and facilitation of a pipeline of  projects  involving EU companies; 1.2 Selected and promising projects connected to downstream financing and investment instruments  , especially through the Global Gateway Investment Hub;1.3 Project-focused dialogues on enabling business environment and collaboration strengthened, including along responsible business conduct and women economic empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
